{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"chain_hook","model_identifier":"chain_hook","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# chain_hook\n\nChain hook: a barbed iron hook a climbing demon throws to pull units down off walls, about 40 cm (14 u) with a short length of chain. Origin at the centre, hook point along -Z.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -4..4, y -1..1, z -7..14 units (0.25 x 0.06 x 0.60 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 16 x 32, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 13.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 9 x 2 x 22 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 4\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_chain` at (0, 0, 14)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Projectile: origin at its centre, point (direction of flight) along -Z. No animation; the game moves and spins it.\n- The game draws a line of `chain_link` pieces from `slot_chain` back to the thrower.\n"},"resolution":{"width":16,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"shank","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.75,-0.75,-4.0],"to":[0.75,0.75,4.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[6.25,15.25,7.75,16.75],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[2.0,8.25,10.0,9.75],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[6.25,15.25,7.75,16.75],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[2.0,8.25,10.0,9.75],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.25,0.0,1.75,8.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.25,0.0,1.75,8.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8b559588-a8ce-58aa-b39c-9c30eb12e0b5"},{"name":"eye","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.5,-0.5,4.0],"to":[1.5,0.5,